<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Maintenance - Forest</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Forest is temporarily unavailable while maintenance is in progress.">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: light;
            font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            color: #18221b;
            background: #f5f7f5;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(82, 121, 92, 0.12), transparent 34rem),
                #f5f7f5;
        }
        main {
            width: min(100%, 36rem);
            padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            border: 1px solid #dce4de;
            border-radius: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 1.5rem 4rem rgba(31, 48, 36, 0.08);
        }
        .wordmark {
            margin: 0 0 3rem;
            font-size: 1.125rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.025em;
        }
        .status {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
            color: #41634a;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .status::before {
            width: 0.5rem;
            height: 0.5rem;
            content: "";
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #5d8a68;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.25rem rgba(93, 138, 104, 0.14);
        }
        h1 {
            margin: 0;
            color: #17251b;
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 3rem);
            line-height: 1.08;
            letter-spacing: -0.045em;
        }
        .message {
            max-width: 28rem;
            margin: 1.25rem auto 0;
            color: #607066;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .retry {
            margin: 2rem 0 0;
            color: #34483a;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <p class="wordmark">forest</p>
        <p class="status">Maintenance in progress</p>
        <h1>We&rsquo;ll be back shortly.</h1>
        <p class="message">The entire application is temporarily unavailable while we carry out maintenance.</p>
        <p class="retry">Please try again in a few minutes.</p>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
